---

<Layout title="Harald Bregu — Senior Lead Developer">
  <article>
    <header>
      <img
        src="/avatar-placeholder.svg"
        alt="Harald Bregu"
        width="120"
        height="120"
        class="avatar"
      />
      <h1>Hi, I'm Harald</h1>
      <p>
        Senior Lead Developer passionate about building scalable, robust, and
        cross-platform applications including desktop, web, and mobile
        solutions.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>
        I'm Harald Bregu, a Senior Lead Developer with extensive expertise in
        cross-platform development, web, mobile, and backend systems. I have a
        proven track record of leading development teams and delivering
        reliable, scalable software solutions across various industries.
        Currently building a cross-platform desktop text editor for critical
        applications, my skills include Angular, ReactJS, Swift, Kotlin,
        Node.js, and desktop application development. I am passionate about
        staying updated with the latest technologies to provide innovative
        solutions that meet current and future challenges.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Work Experience</h2>
      {
        work.map((item) => (
          <article class="job">
            <h3>
              {item.role} · {item.company}
            </h3>
            <p class="dates">
              <em>{item.dates}</em>
            </p>
            {item.description && <p>{item.description}</p>}
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <ul class="skills">
        {skills.map((skill) => <li>{skill}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Have a question or want to discuss a potential project? Feel free to
        reach out via email at <a href="mailto:harald.bregu@gmail.com"
          >harald.bregu@gmail.com</a
        >. I'll do my best to respond promptly.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please note that I focus on professional inquiries related to Web and
        Mobile frontend development opportunities. I respectfully ask that you
        refrain from sending unsolicited marketing messages.
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <hr />
      <p><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Harald Bregu</small></p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .avatar {
    display: block;
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .job {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .job h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .job h3 + p {
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #59636e;
  }

  footer p {
    color: #59636e;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
